        "original_id": "91d41b46-311c-5c27-bce7-b130a760ab01",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Verna Bloom, Jay Cocks, John Landis, Ivan Reitman, Matty Simmons, John Belushi, Tim Matheson, John Vernon, Thomas Hulce, Stephen Furst, Donald Sutherland\n- Films: National Lampoon's Animal House, The Last Temptation of Christ\n- Companies: Universal Pictures\n\nFacts:\n- Verna Bloom has had roles in more than 30 films and television episodes since the 1960s.\n- National Lampoon's Animal House is a 1978 American comedy film from Universal Pictures.\n- National Lampoon's Animal House was produced by Ivan Reitman and Matty Simmons and directed by John Landis.\n- National Lampoon's Animal House stars John Belushi, Tim Matheson, John Vernon, Verna Bloom, Thomas Hulce, Stephen Furst, and Donald Sutherland.\n- In 1978, Verna Bloom played Marion Wormer in National Lampoon's Animal House.\n- In 1988, Verna Bloom played Mary, mother of Jesus, in The Last Temptation of Christ.\n- Jay Cocks is married to actress Verna Bloom.",
